<title>UK: France Telecom sets 2.0 bln FFR bond.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sets 2.0 bln FFR bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANCE TELECOM</p>
<p> AMT ** 2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    25.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.419   PAY DATE    26.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    99.469    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** REOPENING OF EXISTING BOND, TOTAL NOW 6.0 BLN FFR</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APRIL 2007 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	FEES SPLIT 0.75 PLACEMENT, 0.45 GUARANTEE AND 0.10</p>
<p>		DIRECTION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
